#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
AI-Carmine Codex App MCP server.

Codex-App-only adapter:
- MCP JSON-RPC over stdio.
- No OpenWebUI 3571 bridge.
- No POST to 3572/vulkan/agent.
- No agentic loop, no selector, no planner job lifecycle.
- Repository tools are dispatched directly through the in-repo tool dispatcher.
- Memory tools are read-only SQLite/context helpers and remain enabled.
- stdout is reserved for MCP frames only; diagnostics go to stderr only.

Codex starts this process itself from .codex/config.toml.
Do not run it as a long-lived TCP/HTTP service.
"""

